## 10. Snow fox — loc_ice_cream_kiosk, loc_sprinkler, loc_laundry (level_3)

animal-snow_fox = Snow fox
animal-snow_fox-more = More about the snow fox

# Facts (never a place word, ANIM-007); kiga: one word next to a picture
mission-snow_fox-facts-kiga = snow
mission-snow_fox-facts-klasse1 = My fur is thick. I like snow. I eat berries.
mission-snow_fox-facts-klasse2 = Snow foxes live in the far north, where it is very cold. In winter their fur is white, in summer it is brown. Their bushy tail keeps them warm like a scarf.
mission-snow_fox-facts-klasse3 = The snow fox is also called the arctic fox and lives in the cold north. Its fur is so thick that it stays warm even in great cold. In winter it is white, in summer brown, so that it can always hide well. When it sleeps, it wraps its bushy tail around its nose like a scarf. It likes to eat berries and can even hear quiet sounds under the snow.

# loc_ice_cream_kiosk — ice cream kiosk with a freezer chest and cones
mission-snow_fox-riddle-loc_ice_cream_kiosk-kiga = ice cream
mission-snow_fox-riddle-loc_ice_cream_kiosk-klasse1 = I am too warm. I like it cold. There are waffles here.
mission-snow_fox-riddle-loc_ice_cream_kiosk-klasse2 = The snow fox is much too warm. It sits where children buy cold, sweet scoops in a cone.
mission-snow_fox-riddle-loc_ice_cream_kiosk-klasse3 = The snow fox comes from a land full of snow. Today the zoo is much too warm for it. It found a place where cold air blows out of a chest. Children buy cones with colourful scoops there.

# loc_sprinkler — lawn with a turning sprinkler, cold drops, rainbow
mission-snow_fox-riddle-loc_sprinkler-kiga = sprinkler
mission-snow_fox-riddle-loc_sprinkler-klasse1 = I am too hot. Cold drops rain down. A rainbow!
mission-snow_fox-riddle-loc_sprinkler-klasse2 = The snow fox sits on wet grass. Something there turns and sprays cold water in a circle, and a rainbow shines in the drops.
mission-snow_fox-riddle-loc_sprinkler-klasse3 = The snow fox comes from a land where it snows nearly all the time. Today it is far too warm for it. It has found a lawn where a little machine turns round and round and scatters cool drops. The grass is shiny and wet, and a small rainbow shimmers in the air.

# loc_laundry — washing line with big white sheets
mission-snow_fox-riddle-loc_laundry-kiga = laundry
mission-snow_fox-riddle-loc_laundry-klasse1 = My fur is white. Everything here is white. The wind blows.
mission-snow_fox-riddle-loc_laundry-klasse2 = The snow fox hides between big white sheets that flap on a line in the wind. White on white, you can hardly see it.
mission-snow_fox-riddle-loc_laundry-klasse3 = In winter the snow fox's fur is as white as snow. That helps it to hide well. Today it has found a place where the zookeepers have hung big white sheets and towels out to dry. It sits very still between the flapping sheets and hopes that nobody will spot it.

